      "preview_caveats": [
        "Initialization visibility is an explicit preview from static ARM64 fallback evidence; successful native Awake/init and IFix execution are unobserved.",
        "The retained GameObjectData has 86 entries; native Awake requests 94. Additional binding entries remain unresolved.",
        "Only the listed GO activeSelf values are overridden. Inactive parents also hide descendants; source records remain retained.",
        "The constructor zoom default 15 is not applied as RawImage UVs or a transform scale. Runtime texture, UV assignment and inherited scale remain unresolved.",
        "Later show/update calls, pooled sound objects and gameplay events can produce different visibility.",
        "Hierarchy paths and field names are provenance labels. Only full bundle/CAB/GameObject identities select visibility targets.",
        "Direct false calls and dictionary-value false calls describe an initialization phase; they do not establish visibility in an arbitrary gameplay frame.",
        "The internal reciprocal-zoom Rect is not a verified RawImage UV assignment. Authored UV [0,0,1,1] is retained.",
        "Metadata slot 0x462E2F8 and final image/icon parent transforms remain unresolved; [2,2,2] is not an applied binding.",
        "The minimap RawImage texture remains unbound. BattleMapPanel's Map_map binding does not prove the minimap texture.",
        "Supplied canvas resolution, PPU and scale rule are preview inputs; successful source-runtime ancestry and pixel equality remain unverified."
      ],
      "preview_mode": "initialization",
      "report": "initialization-1920x1080.json",
      "scale_factor": 1.0
    },
